# English for the operator panel's language switch.
#
# This project writes its own interface strings in Persian, in the code: the
# model labels and help, the panel's columns and actions, a few templates. This
# file is their English, so the switch the owner asked for turns the whole
# panel English rather than Django's half of it. Django and Unfold bring their
# own English.
#
# Compile with scripts/compile_messages.py. A test fails if a Persian string
# the panel hands to gettext has no entry here, or if the .mo on disk does not
# match this file (apps/catalog/tests/test_panel_translations.py).
